    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Poko lowo i dier nonin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me nyingi nonin ma Isiraili. Cako i kew ma yumalo, i royo ma Hethlon, wok i Lebohamath, tundo kiri Harayenon manitie i kew ma Damasiko gi Hamath yumalo, yuthenge ma yuwok ceŋ nam tundo yupodho ceŋ, labedo adec pa nono Dan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma kewere g'adec pa Dan, wok yuwok ceŋ tundo yupodho ceŋ, labedo adec pa nono Aser. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma kewere g'adec pa Aser, wok yuwok ceŋ tundo yupodho ceŋ, labedo adec pa nono Nafital. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma kewere g'adec pa Nafital, wok yuwok ceŋ tundo yupodho ceŋ, labedo adec pa nono Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma kewere g'adec pa Manase, wok yuwok ceŋ tundo yupodho ceŋ, labedo adec pa nono Efrayim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma kewere g'adec pa Efrayim, wok yuwok ceŋ tundo yupodho ceŋ, labedo adec pa Ruben. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma kewere g'adec pa Ruben, wok yuwok ceŋ tundo yupodho ceŋ, labedo adec pa nono Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Adec manyakare i dier lowo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adec ma kewere g'apa Yuda, wok yuwok ceŋ tundo yupodho ceŋ, labedo ma wiripo ketho gicen. Ripo bedo mita apar g'ario g'adec i laco aka boro mere ripo rom g'adec pa nonin, wok yuwok ceŋ tundo yupodho ceŋ, gi Ot pa Were i diere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adec ma wilaketho gicen ri Rwoth labedo kilomita apar g'ario g'adec i boro kodi kilomita apar i laco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me labedo adec maleŋ. Jocway ri Were i wi migam jolatero adec ma romo kilomita apar g'ario g'adec wok yuwok ceŋ tundo yupodho ceŋ kodi kilomita abic wok yumalo tundo yupiny gi Ot pa Rwoth i diere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adec me labedo apa jocway ri Were i wi migam ma jobedo nyikway Zadok, ma jotiyo ran g'adieri, ma jok'oriwere gi Joisiraili munyo jonyeko, paka Jolevi man jotimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adec me labedo apajo paka adec manyakare wok kwoŋ adec maleŋ ma lowo, Kabedo Maleŋ loyo, ma kewere kodi adec pa Jolevi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma kewere kodi adec pa jocway ri Were i wi migam, Jolevi bende jolabedo g'adec ma kilomita apar g'ario g'adec wok yuwok ceŋ tundo yupodho ceŋ, kodi kilomita abic wok yumalo tundo yupiny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jokiripi kitana kosa wilo gi giman je aka jokiripi poko adec ma lowo m'oyer me, kwoŋbedo obedo maleŋ ri Rwoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adec m'odoŋ, kilomita apar g'ario g'adec kodi kilomita ario g'adec, ilaoro ri tindi madwoŋ, ma bed'iye kodi kam'othangere. I diere mere ripo bedo tindi madwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me labedo rapim mere, yumalo mita 2,250 yupiny mita 2,250 yuwok ceŋ mita 2,250 kodi yupodho ceŋ mita 2,250. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tindi madwoŋ labedo gi kam'othangere, yumalo mita 125 yupiny mita 125 yuwok ceŋ mita 125 kodi yupodho ceŋ mita 125. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adec lowo ma kewere g'adec lowo maleŋ labedo kilomita abic yuwok ceŋ, kilomita abic yupodho ceŋ. Cemo m'ifuro iye labedo apa jotic ma tindi madwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jotic ma tindi madwoŋ wok i kisi nono jolafur'iye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adec je ma wiripo ketho gicen ripo bedo kilomita apar g'ario g'adec i kisi thenge, aka wilawodho mic ma leŋo wobedi apa tindi madwoŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adec m'odoŋ mar'adec maleŋ kodi lim ma tindi madwoŋ labedo apa wod kere. Ripo cako wok iy'adec ma kilomita 2,250 i kew ma yuwok ceŋ kodi i kew ma yupodho ceŋ kilomita 2,250 tirtir g'adec pa nonin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lim pa Jolevi ripo bedo i dier lim pa wod kere. Adec pa kere labedo i dier adec pa Yuda kodi adec pa Benyamin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lowo ri nonin man",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paka ri nonin m'odoŋ, wok yuwok ceŋ tundo yupodho ceŋ, labedo adec pa nono Benyamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma kewere g'adec pa Benyamin, wok yuwok ceŋ tundo yupodho ceŋ, labedo apa nono Simeo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma kewere g'adec pa Simeo, wok yuwok ceŋ tundo yupodho ceŋ, labedo adec pa nono Isakar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma kewere g'adec pa Isakar, wok yuwok ceŋ tundo yupodho ceŋ, labedo adec pa nono Zebulun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma kewere g'adec pa Zebulun, wok yuwok ceŋ tundo yupodho ceŋ, labedo adec pa nono Gad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma kewere g'adec pa Gad yupiny, kew lawok Tamar kiri i pi ma Meriba Kades, aka wok kenyo i thengi kew ma Misir tundo kiri i Nam Madwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
